---
import content from '../data/installation-service.json';
---
<section id="hang-muc-thi-cong" class="installation-categories lp-section"><div class="container"><div class="lp-section-heading"><div><p class="lp-kicker">Từ kính đến bề mặt nội thất</p><h2>Các hạng mục thi công</h2></div><p>Phương án được lựa chọn theo vật liệu, vị trí dán và hiện trạng công trình. Hình ảnh giúp bạn tham khảo cách ứng dụng.</p></div><div class="installation-service-grid">{content.services.map(item=><article><figure><img src={item.image} alt={item.alt} width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{item.tag}</figcaption></figure><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="ban-giao-thi-cong" class="container lp-section"><div class="lp-detail-list"><details><summary>Kiểm tra & bàn giao sau thi công</summary><ul>{content.handover.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><a href="/du-an">Xem công trình thực tế →</a></details></div></section>
<style>
.installation-categories { background: #f3f8fd; border-block: 1px solid #e0eaf5; }
.installation-service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.installation-service-grid article { overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dce6f2; border-radius: 16px; }
.installation-service-grid figure { margin: 0; aspect-ratio: 4/3; position: relative; background: #eaf1f8; }
.installation-service-grid img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.installation-service-grid figcaption { position: absolute; left: 12px; bottom: 12px; right: 12px; max-width: calc(100% - 24px); width: fit-content; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #fffffff0; color: #52657c; font-size: 12px; }
.installation-service-grid article > div { padding: 22px; }
.installation-service-grid h3, .installation-options h3, .installation-reason-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #244766; }
.installation-service-grid p, .installation-options p, .installation-reason-grid p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #52677c; }
.installation-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 24px; }
.installation-options article { padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid #dce6f2; border-radius: 14px; }
.installation-options article > span { font-family: 'Lexend Variable',sans-serif !important; font-size: 25px; color: #3182c5; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.installation-options a { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: auto; color: #0d6b96; font-size: 14px; }
.installation-brief, .installation-reasons { background: #f3f8fd; border-block: 1px solid #e0eaf5; }
.installation-brief-grid, .installation-handover { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
.installation-brief p:not(.lp-kicker), .installation-handover > div > p:not(.lp-kicker) { font-size: 16px; color: #52677c; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.installation-brief ul { display: grid; gap: 14px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.installation-brief li { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #e1eaf4; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; color: #52657c; font-size: 15px; }
.installation-brief li span { color: #0d6b96; }
.installation-handover ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.installation-handover li { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 16px; padding: 18px; border-left: 2px solid #c7daf0; background: #f8fbff; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; }
.installation-handover li span { font-size: 16px; color: #3182c5; }
.installation-handover li p { font-size: 15px; color: #52657c; margin: 0; }
.installation-reason-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 24px 32px; }
.installation-reason-grid article { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 14px; }
.installation-reason-grid article > span { display: inline-flex; flex-shrink: 0; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e4efff; color: #0d6b96; }
@media(max-width:1023px) { .installation-service-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } .installation-options { gap: 16px; } .installation-brief-grid, .installation-handover { gap: 32px; } }
@media(max-width:767px) { .installation-service-grid, .installation-options, .installation-brief-grid, .installation-handover, .installation-reason-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } .installation-service-grid article > div, .installation-options article { padding: 20px; } }
</style>
